# Moddy Arena: the wish ladder, limits that rise as a battle goes on and start again every battle. In prep his wishes
# are fitted to the first step: /moddy wishes and the WISH LADDER board beside the control panel say it, the board in a
# few big lines read from where he stands; a giant dragon from the Apprentice is made smaller and he is told once, and
# it stays in the prep room, hurt; the strongest sword comes out as the strongest the step allows (a hit of at most two
# and a half hearts); a tornado (an event) is made at the first step's size in prep, and the dragon and a ready-made
# meteor go on his hotbar. In a ten-wave battle the meteor fired from the hotbar is locked with the arena's words until
# wave 5; clearing wave 2 raises the ladder as a moment at the start of the break (a title, a line of what rose, a
# fanfare, and the core's one line about his creatures): the dragon in the prep room has more health at once, without
# being made again, and is just as hurt; the board says where the battle is, and the dragon fired after wave 4 has that
# step's health; clearing the boss wave opens events, and the meteor fires. After the battle the prep room's dragon is
# held back to the first step (he is told once), and the next battle starts at the first step again: the same hotbar
# dragon comes out small, the meteor is locked again, and no creature from the first battle is left in the arena.
# No model anywhere: the Apprentice's local matcher offers the makes. A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the
# monsters are removed by command (the fighting is 4-battle-won's).
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent the arena's limits are a battle's: prep makes are fitted to the first step, clearing waves raises the limits as a moment so living wished creatures grow and hotbar wishes come out stronger and a locked event opens, and the next battle starts at the first step again with the creatures held back to it
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step he arrives: wishes are fitted to the first step
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
moddy wishes
@expect chat Wish limits (Before a battle: the first step): health up to 20 hearts, hits up to 2.5 hearts within 5s
@expect chat events locked in a battle until wave 5 within 1s
@expect chat After wave 2 of a battle: Health up to 30 hearts within 1s
@expect chat Every battle starts at the first step within 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder]

@step the WISH LADDER board beside the control panel says it in big words, read from where he stands
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_where,nbt={text:{text:"Before a battle: step 1"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_now_1,nbt={text:{text:"Health: 20 hearts"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_next,nbt={text:{text:"After wave 2: health 30 hearts"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_locked,nbt={text:{text:"Battle locks: Events, World rules"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@aim pos -4.9 65.7 19.0
@wait 10s
@shot ladder-board-in-prep-from-the-standing-spot
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.0 90 0
@wait 2s
@shot ladder-board-in-prep

@step a giant dragon is made smaller for this world, and he is told once
# made standing just inside the arena, so it lands (one started in the prep room is handed over: 23-prep-hand-over)
teleport @s 0.5 64 14.5 180 12
@wait 1s
moddy apprentice a giant dragon
@expect screen Container within 10s
@wait 1s
@shot dragon-page
@click slot 0
@expect chat Made a bit smaller for this world within 30s
@expect chat /Dragon is ready/ within 90s
@wait 2s
execute store result score #sc0 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=wishmob,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:scale get 100
@assert execute if score #sc0 arenatest matches ..150
@shot dragon-fitted
tag @e[tag=wishmob] add premade

@step a rock golem is made in prep, its health held to the first step, and left hurt in the prep room
moddy apprentice a rock golem
@expect screen Container within 10s
@wait 1s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 2s
# it stays in the prep room through the battle, held still (SHORTCUT: NoAI, so it never walks into the arena and is
# cleared at the battle's end), hurt: it is never made again
tag @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!premade,limit=1,sort=nearest] add prepgolem
data merge entity @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] {NoAI:1b}
teleport @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] 3.0 64 24.0
scoreboard players set #k1000 arenatest 1000
execute store result score #m0 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get 100
# a rock golem's own health is far more; it is held to the first step: 20 hearts (40 health)
@assert execute if score #m0 arenatest matches 3990..4000
damage @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] 8 minecraft:generic
@wait 5t
execute store result score #h0 arenatest run data get entity @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] Health 100
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest = #h0 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest *= #k1000 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest /= #m0 arenatest
@assert execute if score #r0 arenatest matches 1..999

@step the strongest sword comes out as the strongest the first step allows
moddy apprentice the strongest sword ever
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat Made a bit gentler for this world within 30s
@expect chat /is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@key key.hotbar.3
@wait 10t
execute store result score #atk arenatest run attribute @s minecraft:attack_damage get 10
# a hit of at most two and a half hearts (5 health), the player's own 1 included: a stone sword at most
@assert execute if score #atk arenatest matches 20..50
@key key.hotbar.9

@step a tornado in prep is made at the first step's size
moddy apprentice a tornado
@expect screen Container within 10s
@wait 1s
@shot tornado-page-in-prep
@click slot 0
@expect chat Here it comes within 10s
@expect chat Locked gone within 5s
@wait 5s

@step the dragon and a ready-made meteor (an event) go on his hotbar from their pages
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "Dragon"
@expect screen Dragon within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 4 within 10s
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "meteor" right
@expect screen /meteor/ within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 5 within 10s
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
@key key.hotbar.9

@step he sets ten waves and starts the battle
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos -0.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect actionbar Waves: 10 within 3s
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.forward hold 20t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting! 10 waves of monsters within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 10 within 15s

@step wave 1: the hotbar dragon comes out small, and the meteor is locked with the arena's words
execute as @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!prepgolem] run kill @s
@aim look 180 10
@key key.hotbar.4
@key key.use
@expect chat /Dragon is ready/ within 60s
@wait 2s
execute store result score #sc1 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!prepgolem,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:scale get 100
@assert execute if score #sc1 arenatest matches ..150
# battle roles' signs, read from about 5 and about 20 blocks: three wished stand-ins side by side (held still), so
# their signs must stay clear of one another (the chat faded first)
@key key.hotbar.9
summon minecraft:wolf 0.5 64 5.5 {NoAI:1b,Tags:["moddy_wished","ladderpets"]}
summon minecraft:camel 1.5 64 5.5 {NoAI:1b,Tags:["moddy_wished","ladderpets"]}
summon minecraft:sheep -0.5 64 5.5 {NoAI:1b,Tags:["moddy_wished","ladderpets"]}
teleport @s 0.5 64 0.5 0 -8
@wait 10s
@shot role-signs-5-blocks
teleport @s 0.5 64 -14.5 0 -2
@wait 2s
@shot role-signs-20-blocks
kill @e[tag=ladderpets]
teleport @s 0.5 64 22.5 180 10
@wait 10t
@key key.hotbar.5
@key key.use
@expect chat Locked: opens in a battle, after wave 5 within 10s
@wait 5t
@shot meteor-locked-in-battle
@key key.hotbar.9
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s

@step clearing wave 2 raises the ladder, as a moment at the start of the break
@expect title Wave 2 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
# how hurt the prep room's golem is just before the step opens (its body heals a little over time)
execute store result score #h1 arenatest run data get entity @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] Health 100
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest = #h1 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest *= #k1000 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r0 arenatest /= #m0 arenatest
@assert execute if score #r0 arenatest matches 1..999
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared within 10s
@expect title Stronger wishes! within 3s
@expect chat Your wishes can be stronger now: health up to 30 hearts, hits up to 3 hearts within 3s
@expect chat Your creatures are stronger now! within 3s
@wait 10t
@shot moment-after-wave-2
@step the rock golem made in prep is stronger now, without being made again, and just as hurt
execute store result score #m2 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get 100
@assert execute if score #m2 arenatest > #m0 arenatest
@assert execute if score #m2 arenatest matches ..6000
execute store result score #h2 arenatest run data get entity @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] Health 100
scoreboard players operation #r2 arenatest = #h2 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r2 arenatest *= #k1000 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #r2 arenatest /= #m2 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #d arenatest = #r2 arenatest
scoreboard players operation #d arenatest -= #r0 arenatest
@assert execute if score #d arenatest matches -15..15
moddy wishes
@expect chat Wish limits (This battle: 2 waves cleared): health up to 30 hearts within 5s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_where,nbt={text:{text:"This battle: 2 waves cleared"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_now_1,nbt={text:{text:"Health: 30 hearts"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@aim pos -4.9 65.7 19.0
@wait 10s
@shot ladder-board-in-battle-from-the-standing-spot
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.0 90 0
@wait 2s
@shot ladder-board-in-battle

@step after wave 4 the hotbar dragon is fitted to the step the battle is on
teleport @s 0.5 64 22.5 180 10
@expect title Wave 3 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 4 cleared within 10s
@expect title Stronger wishes! within 3s
execute as @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!prepgolem] run kill @s
@key key.hotbar.4
@key key.use
@expect chat /Dragon is ready/ within 60s
@wait 2s
execute store result score #sc4 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!prepgolem,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:scale get 100
# fitted to the step now (size at most x2). It is not bigger than in wave 1: the core keeps a Builder make's recipe as
# it was made, already fitted to the first step in prep, so a later step has nothing more to give it (a core gap)
@assert execute if score #sc4 arenatest matches ..200
@shot dragon-after-wave-4
@key key.hotbar.9

@step clearing the boss wave opens events, and the hotbar meteor fires
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 30s
@wait 2s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 5 cleared within 10s
@expect chat Events are open now! within 3s
@wait 10t
@shot moment-events-open
@key key.hotbar.5
@key key.use
@expect chat Locked gone within 8s
@shot meteor-in-battle
@key key.hotbar.9

@step waves 6 to 10, and the battle is won
@expect title Wave 6 of 10 within 60s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 7 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 8 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 9 of 10 within 25s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 30s
@wait 1s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@expect chat Your creatures are held back a little in this world for now within 5s

@step after the battle: back at the first step, nothing wished is left in the arena, and the prep room's rock golem is held back again
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=wishmob,x=-15,y=63,z=-15,dx=30,dy=10,dz=30]
execute store result score #m9 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=prepgolem,limit=1] minecraft:max_health get 100
@assert execute if score #m9 arenatest = #m0 arenatest
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_ladder_where,nbt={text:{text:"Before a battle: step 1"}}]
moddy wishes
@expect chat Wish limits (Before a battle: the first step): health up to 20 hearts within 5s
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@aim pos -4.9 65.7 19.0
@wait 5s
@shot ladder-board-after-the-battle

@step the next battle starts at the first step again: the hotbar dragon is small and the meteor locked
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.forward hold 20t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting! 10 waves of monsters within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 10 within 15s
@aim look 180 10
@key key.hotbar.4
@key key.use
@expect chat /Dragon is ready/ within 60s
@wait 2s
execute store result score #sc2 arenatest run attribute @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!prepgolem,limit=1,sort=nearest] minecraft:scale get 100
@assert execute if score #sc2 arenatest matches ..150
@key key.hotbar.5
@key key.use
@expect chat Locked: opens in a battle, after wave 5 within 10s
@key key.hotbar.9
